    desc:'The user\'s assigned plan (Business Premium, M365 E3, M365 E5, or Office 365 E3/E5) already includes Entra ID Premium P1. The standalone add-on is redundant.',
    recommendation:'Remove the standalone Entra ID P1 license.'
